  "name": "EBSTEIN - BARR (EBV) NUCLEAR ANTIGEN (EBV-NA) - IgG ANTIBODIES",
  "code": "2726",
  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"955\">\n<p data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"955\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"835\">Negative (&lt;18 U/mL):</strong> No detectable EBV-NA IgG antibodies.</span><br data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"875\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&rarr; Suggests no prior infection or very early phase (before antibody formation).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"1070\">\n<p data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"1070\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"959\" data-end=\"986\">Equivocal (18&ndash;21 U/mL):</strong> Borderline result.</span><br data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1008\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&rarr; Suggest retesting after 2&ndash;3 weeks if clinically indicated.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1256\">\n<p data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1256\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"1074\" data-end=\"1098\">Positive (&gt;21 U/mL):</strong> EBV-NA IgG antibodies detected.</span><br data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1133\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&rarr; Suggests past infection and immune response.</span><br data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1184\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\">&rarr; Usually appears <strong data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1233\">6&ndash;8 weeks after infection</strong> and persists for life.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
